    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To detect text appearing inside an image, I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a concrete external provider for optical character recognition (OCR). I will write the Python code for the file 'detect_image_text.py' that uses the Amazon Textract client from the Boto3 library to perform the OCR task. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789859626732,
          "start": 1789859624486
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf27626001msk5QlLhjpETpy",
